*-policy.json
ui/.env.local
.gstack/

# Obsidian vault (personal notes, decisions, session handoffs — not source;
# see vault boundaries note: GitHub = code, Obsidian = notes).
# Anchored to the repo root (/bu/, not bu/) - an unanchored "bu/" pattern
# also matches any directory literally named "bu" at any depth, which
# silently swallowed the entire edu.bu Java package tree
# (api/src/{main,test}/java/edu/bu/...) until this was caught and fixed
# 2026-08-04. Same reasoning applies to .obsidian/ even though no
# api/src/**/.obsidian/ collision currently exists - anchor defensively.
/bu/
/.obsidian/
